{"summary": "Stage cluster scan shows no critical or high issues. Kubescape reports NSA 14 passed/7 failed and MITRE 12 passed/5 failed, mainly missing network policies, resource limits, ':latest' image tags and missing seccomp profiles in the shop namespace. The only admin binding is cluster-admin to Group:/system:masters, which looks like a platform default. Node/control-plane CIS checks and git history were not assessed.", "targets": ["stage"], "frameworks": [{"name": "NSA", "passed": 14, "failed": 7, "skipped": 5, "score": 70}, {"name": "MITRE", "passed": 12, "failed": 5, "skipped": 5, "score": 75}, {"name": "Trivy PSS", "passed": 16, "failed": 1, "skipped": 0, "score": null}], "findings": [{"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "No network policies restricting ingress/egress", "resource": "shop/Deployment/cart, shop/Deployment/web (14 resources total)", "controls": ["C-0030"], "evidence": "Kubescape failed control C-0030 (Ingress and Egress blocked) on 14 resources, e.g. shop/Deployment/cart.", "fix": "Add a default-deny NetworkPolicy: kubectl apply -f - <<EOF
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy
metadata: {name: default-deny, namespace: shop}
spec: {podSelector: {}, policyTypes: [Ingress, Egress]}
EOF
then allow required flows.", "confidence": "high"}, {"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "Containers missing memory limits/requests", "resource": "shop/Deployment/web (9 resources)", "controls": ["C-0004"], "evidence": "Kubescape failed C-0004 (Resources memory limit and request) on 9 resources, e.g. shop/Deployment/web.", "fix": "resources:
  requests: {memory: 128Mi}
  limits: {memory: 256Mi}", "confidence": "high"}, {"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "Image tag ':latest' used", "resource": "shop/Deployment/cart, web, worker", "controls": ["KSV-0013"], "evidence": "Trivy KSV-0013 (Image tag ':latest' used) has count 3 across cart, web and worker.", "fix": "Pin images to a specific version or digest, e.g. image: repo/app:1.2.3@sha256:<digest>", "confidence": "high"}, {"severity": "MEDIUM", "title": "Seccomp profile not set", "resource": "3 workloads (Trivy PSS control 10)", "controls": ["Trivy PSS 10"], "evidence": "Trivy PSS control 10 (Seccomp) shows fails: 3.", "fix": "securityContext:
  seccompProfile: {type: RuntimeDefault}", "confidence": "high"}, {"severity": "LOW", "title": "cluster-admin bound to system:masters (likely platform default)", "resource": "ClusterRoleBinding cluster-admin", "controls": ["rbac_and_argo"], "evidence": "Binding cluster-admin gives role cluster-admin to Group:/system:masters; no other admin bindings listed.", "fix": "No change if default; restrict membership of system:masters and use scoped roles for users.", "confidence": "medium"}, {"severity": "LOW", "title": "Missing CPU/resource policies and limits", "resource": "shop/Deployment/cart (14 resources)", "controls": ["C-0009", "KSV-0011"], "evidence": "Kubescape C-0009 (Resource policies) failed on 14 resources and Trivy KSV-0011 (CPU not limited) hit shop/Deployment/cart.", "fix": "Add a LimitRange/ResourceQuota in shop and set resources.limits.cpu: 500m on containers.", "confidence": "high"}, {"severity": "LOW", "title": "Medium image vulnerabilities, no critical/high", "resource": "stage cluster images", "controls": [], "evidence": "Trivy vuln_counts shows MEDIUM: 6 and critical_high_vulns is empty; Trivy misconfig_counts show LOW: 14.", "fix": "Rebuild images on updated base images; review trivy output for fixed versions.", "confidence": "medium"}], "not_checked": [{"item": "node and control-plane CIS checks", "reason": "need a privileged node-collector pod; the audit identity is read-only"}, {"item": "git history", "reason": "secrets removed from history are not scanned"}, {"item": "repos", "reason": "digest contains no repo results"}]}
